  **Decision:** Scheduled Pipeline Restock Job
  **Why:** The scheduled pipeline job removes the manual weekly check and uses the preferred platform. It advances the accepted objective that early restock keeps orders shipping within one day, and it is bound by the accepted control that the job must not read payment data.
